<title>NORWAY: Norway manufacturing output down 0.6 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway manufacturing output down 0.6 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p>NORWAY TOTAL INDUSTRY PRODUCTION MAY</p>
<p>(seasonally adjusted, month-on-month percentage change)</p>
<p>						    May	     April</p>
<p> Total output				  -2.3	     +7.8</p>
<p> Oil and gas				   -1.2	     +8.5</p>
<p> Manufacturing, mining, quarrying	-0.6	     +1.3</p>
<p> Mining, quarrying			   -5.9	     +1.9</p>
<p> Manufacturing				 -0.6	     +1.6</p>
<p> Electricity supply			   5.8	     +4.0</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
